# Every tool's <link rel="canonical"> points at a clean /tools/slug
# URL, but the actual file lives in its own folder (e.g.
# /wordCounter/index.html). These rules make the canonical URL
# itself resolve (200 = rewrite, serves the file without changing
# the address bar or issuing a redirect), so the canonical tag
# always points at a real, working page.

